  features, out of fold), sending each question to the candidate with the
  highest P(correct) − weight × cost. It averages {{$k.AUCGain}} points over the line
  ({{$k.AUCGainCI}}) and {{$k.AUCHullGain}} over the hull ({{$k.AUCHullGainCI}}). It was designed after the first run
